Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,What stops an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:01.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,elevator full of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,people from falling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:03.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,if every one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:03.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,of its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,cables snaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,First, there are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,four to eight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,cables, and any
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:07.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,one could hold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:08.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,the car alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,If they all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:10.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,broke, a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:11.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,rope would catch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:11.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,you, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,governor rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:13.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,It loops up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:13.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,to a wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:13.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,machine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:15.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Spin it too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,fast, and weights
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,fly out and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:17.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:18.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,The locked rope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,yanks a lever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:19.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and steel wedges
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:21.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,jam against the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:22.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:23.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,The car stops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:24.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:24.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a half
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,feet, a hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,squeeze, not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:27.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,in there, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Elisha Otis proved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,it in 1854
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,by cutting his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:32.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,own rope.
